      ],
      "content": "SP 81 NW          BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON       AYLESBURY ROAD                                                north side 1/25                                           No. 68 Red Lion Public House GV                                             II Public House. C17 altered. Timber framed with colourwashed brick infilling. Old tile roof of irregular shape half hipped at end, 2 levels with large chimney at junction another near E. end. Gabled eaves dormer with 3-light casement in lower western part. 2 storeys and 1-storey with attic. RH part has three 3-light casements to ground floor, two to first floor. LH part has door with small hood and bay window to ground floor. Interior altered, but retaining old timbers and inglenook fireplace. RCHM I p.50 MON.4. Listing NGR: SP8361015318"
    }
